{
  "description": "按文件名搜索文件夹及子文件夹，返回有界路径列表；截断时用同 path/query 和 nextCursor 继续，不把一页无匹配当整个目录无结果。path 省略时从工作空间根目录开始。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "cursor": {
        "format": "uuid",
        "pattern": "^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "limit": {
        "maximum": 9007199254740991,
        "minimum": 1,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "path": {
        "maxLength": 32767,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "query": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "query"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "name": "file.search",
  "version": 1
}
